{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>הפעם הראשונה</b><br>כתלנו — קיר [in the language of the Targum]." "משגיח — looks, as from the place of His dwelling He looks." "מציץ — sees (from our [language]), and some say it is from ציצית of the head." "החרכים — the Targum [of this is] חלון [חרכה]."], :book :song-of-songs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra's commentary on the Canticles" "http://beta.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH002030344/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:44:04.222808270Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}